":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001930","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p042","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m042-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001930","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p042","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m042-0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001930","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p042","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m042-0106","start":106,"end":108,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001930","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p042","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m043-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001930","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p043","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"費無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001930","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p046","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001930","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p046","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m046-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001930","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p046","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji040-021","person_id":"cbr-p001930","title":"少傅","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p041","quote":"平王二年，使費無忌如秦爲太子建取婦。婦好，來，未至，無忌先歸，説平王曰：「秦女好，可自娶，爲太子更求。」平王聽之，卒自娶秦女，生熊珍。更爲太子娶。是時伍奢爲太子太傅，無忌爲少傅。無忌無寵於太子，常讒惡太子建。建時年十五矣，其母蔡女也，無寵於王，王稍益疎外建也。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji040-021:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p041","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"少傅","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0006","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"保存本段授位、任事或既有用稱；原紀年不換算，未知起訖不由首次提及、卒日、逃亡或被俘補造。追稱、制度含義與跨篇身份仍待覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji040-040","person_id":"cbr-p001930","surfaces":["無忌","費無忌"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-040-chu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p041","quote":"平王二年，使費無忌如秦爲太子建取婦。婦好，來，未至，無忌先歸，説平王曰：「秦女好，可自娶，爲太子更求。」平王聽之，卒自娶秦女，生熊珍。更爲太子娶。是時伍奢爲太子太傅，無忌爲少傅。無忌無寵於太子，常讒惡太子建。建時年十五矣，其母蔡女也，無寵於王，王稍益疎外建也。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p042","quote":"六年，使太子建居城父，守邊。無忌又日夜讒太子建於王曰：「自無忌入秦女，太子怨，亦不能無望於王，王少自備焉。且太子居城父，擅兵，外交諸侯，且欲入矣。」平王召其傅伍奢責之。伍奢知無忌讒，乃曰：「王柰何以小臣疎骨肉？」無忌曰：「今不制，後悔也。」於是王遂囚伍奢〈而召其二子而告以免父死〉。乃令司馬奮揚召太子建，欲誅之。太子聞之，亡奔宋。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p043","quote":"無忌曰：「伍奢有二子，不殺者爲楚國患。盍以免其父召之，必至。」於是王使使謂奢：「能致二子則生，不能將死。」奢曰：「尚至，胥不至。」王曰：「何也？」奢曰：「尚之爲人，廉，死節，慈孝而仁，聞召而免父，必至，不顧其死。胥之爲人，智而好謀，勇而矜功，知來必死，必不來。然爲楚國憂者必此子。」於是王使人召之，曰：「來，吾免爾父。」伍尚謂伍胥曰：「聞父免而莫奔，不孝也；父戮莫報，無謀也；度能任事，知也。子其行矣，我其歸死。」伍尚遂歸。伍胥彎弓屬矢，出見使者，曰：「父有罪，何以召其子爲？」將射，使者還走，遂出奔呉。伍奢聞之，曰：「胥亡，楚國危哉。」楚人遂殺伍奢及尚。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p046","quote":"昭王元年，楚衆不説費無忌，以其讒亡太子建，殺伍奢子父與郤宛。宛之宗姓伯氏子及子胥皆奔呉，呉兵數侵楚，楚人怨無忌甚。楚令尹子常誅無忌以説衆，衆乃喜。"}],"rationale":"依本篇明示立、是為及連續敘事暫接，未自動與其他篇候選合併；匿名身分、追稱與年代仍待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p041","text":"平王二年，使費無忌如秦爲太子建取婦。婦好，來，未至，無忌先歸，説平王曰：「秦女好，可自娶，爲太子更求。」平王聽之，卒自娶秦女，生熊珍。更爲太子娶。是時伍奢爲太子太傅，無忌爲少傅。無忌無寵於太子，常讒惡太子建。建時年十五矣，其母蔡女也，無寵於王，王稍益疎外建也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001892","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"費無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001930","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"太子建","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001929","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001930","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001892","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"秦女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001957","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001892","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"秦女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001957","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"熊珍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"伍奢","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001931","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001930","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001930","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0100","start":100,"end":103,"surface":"太子建","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001929","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m041-0104","start":104,"end":105,"surf